1
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:21,000
The Magic Roundabout is a animation, family, comedy
film directed by Frank Passingham.

2
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:36,000
A shaggy, candy-loving puppy named Dougal along with a group of friends embarks on a dangerous journey in an
effort to imprison their oppressor -- the evil ice sorcerer ZeeBad (Zebedee's evil twin).

3
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:51,000
As the world is placed in mortal danger Zeebad who
wants to turn the world to ice.

4
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Doogal and his friends must recover 3 diamonds that are needed to stop him.

5
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Dougal (voice), played by Robbie Williams.

6
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:36,000
Florence (voice), played by Kylie Minogue.

7
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:51,000
Zebedee (voice), played by Ian McKellen.

8
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,000
Ermintrude (voice), played by Joanna Lumley.

9
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:21,000
Brian (voice), played by Jim Broadbent.

10
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
Dylan (voice), played by Bill Nighy.

11
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:51,000
The Magic Roundabout (also known as Sprung!

12
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
The Magic Roundabout; French: Pollux – Le manège enchanté) is a 2005 animated adventure
fantasy comedy film based on the television series  of the same name.

13
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:21,000
Unlike the show, which was presented with stop-motion animation,
the film utilizes computer-generated animation.

14
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:36,000
The story sees a group of unlikely heroes who go on a quest to stop a reawakened villain, who
intends on freezing the world, from retrieving a set of powerful diamonds.

15
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
It was released in France with an original French dub on 2 February 2005, and an
English-language version was released nine days later in the United Kingdom on 11 February.

16
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
In the United States, the film was released as Doogal on 24
February 2006 with a new English cast, dub, and script.

17
01:12:15,000 --> 01:12:21,000
Only Ian McKellen's performance was retained, while Kylie
Minogue redubbed her role from the UK release.

18
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
Whilst the UK and French dub received mixed reviews, the US
dub received overwhelmingly negative reviews.

19
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
The tone is lighthearted.
